      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望能成为让别人心动的存在。\n愿这份心动，永远——相传下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b395aa00f9c495182e11d48180101360c9764a45f3cf07f633dd6132a9d3d77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
